# PHASE 9 — FINAL SECURITY, PERFORMANCE, RESILIENCE, CAPACITY, AND PRE-STAGING READINESS VALIDATION

## PROJECT
Tehran Radar (رادار تهران)

Repository: `bijanbijane/radartehran`

Primary development environment: Google AI Studio

Supplementary environment: GitHub and GitHub Codespaces, only when required and authorized.

Target infrastructure: Cloudflare Workers, Workers Static Assets, Cloudflare Vite Plugin, and selectively approved Cloudflare services.

Existing architecture may include React 19, Vite, TypeScript, Express, Firebase Authentication, Firestore, object storage, and legacy Node.js components.

