Do not label a test VERIFIED_PASS unless the test actually executed and its result was observed.

Do not fabricate:
- Test output.
- Cloudflare resource metrics.
- CPU measurements.
- Memory measurements.
- Production traffic.
- User counts.
- Availability percentages.
- Performance results.
